5 0 0 1 0-1.5Zm0 5h8.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-8.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5ZM2 14a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Zm1-6a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0ZM2 4a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z"></path></svg></button></div><div class="js-snippet-clipboard-copy-unpositioned DirectoryRichtextContent-module__SharedMarkdownContent__hHXUL" data-hpc="true" containertiming="hpc"><article class="markdown-body entry-content container-lg" itemprop="text"><div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h1 tabindex="-1" class="heading-element" dir="auto">Cardano-Options</h1><a id="user-content-cardano-options" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Cardano-Options" href="#cardano-options"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<p dir="auto">A p2p-DeFi protocol for writing, buying, and trading American-style <em>covered</em> options contracts on
the Cardano Settlement Layer.</p>
<p dir="auto">As with all <a href="https://github.com/zhekson1/CSL-DeFi-Protocols">p2p-DeFi protocols</a>, all users maintain
full custody, delegation control, and voting control of their assets at all times. No batchers are
required.</p>
<blockquote>
<p dir="auto">Knowledge of basic Haskell syntax and <code>cardano-cli</code> usage is recommended.</p>
</blockquote>
<p dir="auto">The Getting Started instructions can be found <a href="/fallen-icarus/cardano-options/blob/main/GettingStarted.md">here</a>, and the benchmarks can
be found <a href="/fallen-icarus/cardano-options/blob/main/Benchmarks.md">here</a>.</p>
